{"id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-m-complete.md","title":"M-Complete Set","display":"df-m-complete — M-Complete Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-m-complete","aliases":["92-df-m-complete"],"display":"df-m-complete — M-Complete Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-m-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-m-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-m-complete — M-Complete Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> (many-one reducibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{MComplete}\\)</span> (definition target many-one-complete predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to B\\leq_m A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to B\\leq_m A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是多一完全的</li>\n<li>所有r.e.集都多一可归约到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是最&quot;复杂&quot;的r.e.集</li>\n<li>多一完全 c.e. 集恰为创造集（在固定的可接受编号下）</li>\n<li>例：停机集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K = \\{n : \\varphi_n(n)\\!\\downarrow\\}\">\\(K = \\{n : \\varphi_n(n)\\!\\downarrow\\}\\)</span>是多一完全的</li>\n<li>对满足适当有效性与一致性条件的系统，可证句码集应写成\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThmCode}_G=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid G\\vdash\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ThmCode}_G=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid G\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\)</span>；它是否多一完全须由该系统的表达能力另行证明，不能用对非法码未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}\\)</span> 直接断言</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_m$ (many-one reducibility, see [[92-df-many-one-reducible]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to B\\leq_m A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"K = \\{n : \\varphi_n(n)\\!\\downarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThmCode}_G=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid G\\vdash\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}","display":false}],"bytes":1326,"backlinks":[{"id":"828452ef97907ed6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}$ (set parameter, see [[92-df-m-complete]])"},{"id":"e1cdd4c4623e324f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)$ (m-complete, see [[92-df-m-complete]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]